raw-webgpu includes LibRaw 0.22.2 plus later upstream commits up to 7bfffe2 (CDDL 1.0), Adobe DNG SDK 1.7.1 build 2724,
libjxl 0.11.2 and its Brotli, Highway and skcms dependencies, JPEG 9f, zlib 1.3.2,
